{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳奕迅（Eason）26場錄音演出門票尚未開售，竟已有黃牛聲稱手握門票，更開價過萬元！</p><p>大會鄭重提醒歌迷，這次門票須先登記抽籤，中籤後才能正式購票，現階段任何聲稱「有飛在手」、「保證有位」的說法均不可信，切勿付款受騙！</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:43:05.583326+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:30:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:33.554719+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:33.554719+00:00","content_hash":"0eb0d724a4ba09d5fac1ceb5f85733c04176a39b6300f0365b40a2fe1ff29e65","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}